# Contact form delivery endpoint (optional).
# Any service that accepts a JSON POST and returns 2xx on success works,
# e.g. a Formspree form URL (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx), a serverless
# function, or an existing CRM/MuleSoft lead API.
# When empty, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email app
# addressed to reachus@iyanlabs.com — it never reports a message as "sent".
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
